@step Start the interactive profile wizard, which enrolls both the passphrase and its one-time recovery phrase.
@static aeat config profile create me
@blocked interactive-tty Profile creation must receive and verify the recovery phrase through an interactive terminal.
@step Confirm a profile is active before configuring AEAT authentication.
@result aeat --format json config profile list
@expect result.profiles[0].active == true
@expect exit_code == 0
